    2. Choose one of 4 diagonal directions (dr, dc) in {-1,+1}x{-1,+1}
    3. Build 3x3 bg grid; place marker at (1,1); fill the 3 cells (1+dr,1), (1,1+dc), (1+dr,1+dc) with fill color
